  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Spectral Soul Demon Venerable formed it by comprehending the secluded domain of heaven and earth, the Door of Life and Death. When any living being dies, their soul would return there. After Red Lotus Demon Venerable damaged fate Gu, that power weakened greatly, allowing countless souls to linger in the living world and gradually turn into soul beasts. Fang Yuan completely merged this move into emperor yama, giving his yama children the ability to instantly return. An injured yama child turns into fog, flies back into the emperor robe, and recovers there by spending Fang Yuan’s soul foundation.",
